  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Enter a UniProt accession or PDB code(s) and get live tables from UniProt, PDBe and Europe PMC: structures, papers, protein chains, ligands, transmembrane annotation shown on a 3D structure, sequence alignment and SIFTS mappings, plus PyMOL command snippets to copy into your own session. Data used in the run: public. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
